 {"id": "DB-GAP-048", "status": "complete", "priority": "P3", "complexity": 2, "title": "P3 — `s3 query` (DuckDB httpfs) does not honor AWS_PROFILE — requires direct AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/SECRET env", "reasoning": "Bunker staging evidence 09-17 (las-bunker-03): with AWS_PROFILE=duckbrain + AWS_ENDPOINT_URL set, `duckbrain s3 query` fails 'Authentication Failure - no credentials are provided' while the SAME shell succeeds at `aws s3 ls` (CLI honors the profile) and `duckbrain s3 status` works. Exporting AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY directly makes httpfs queries work immediately (90 rows read from s3:// read-only). Root cause class: DuckDB httpfs (secret manager) reads standard AWS_* env vars, not the ~/.aws/config profile chain git-remote-s3/boto3 use. So the s3 layer splits: git push/pull OK on profile, SQL-over-S3 needs direct keys. DX gap for profile-based installers (our own prod uses profiles). Fix direction: when only a profile is configured, resolve its creds via the AWS CLI/API at s3-query time and inject as temporary env, or document the direct-key requirement in s3 config output. Evidence transcript: bunker /tmp/vitest-bunker.log session, staging probe commands in tick 518 report.", "source": "kara-direct bunker staging 2026-09-17", "created_at": "2026-09-17T04:57:17.000000Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-20T01:45:00-05:00", "worktree": "/home/kara/worktrees/duckbrain-DB-GAP-048", "branch": "wt/DB-GAP-048", "worker_status": "complete", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T01:45:00-05:00", "commit_hash": "95ee0a5", "files_changed": ["src/s3/query.ts", "src/s3/config.ts", "src/s3/cli-query.test.ts"], "lines_added": 320, "lines_removed": 12, "guard_result": "tier2 criterion PASS (verdict c0c7215d, tier2 COMPLETE); tier1 flagged the unrelated OPS-007 heartbeat-budget flake under 4-concurrent-suite load — that test passes solo and on the serial merged-tree gate (155 files / 1226 tests); overall PASS recorded via --force --skip-tier2", "ci_result": "batch push run on 73c298d SUCCESS; closeout run on bce929b SUCCESS; DOC-1 gitreins run on 1a137e9 SUCCESS (gh run list verified)", "worker_summary": "k3@kimi-for-coding worker: s3 query now resolves httpfs credentials in precedence order (direct AWS_*/DUCKBRAIN_S3_* env → AWS_PROFILE/cfg.profile via the AWS SDK v3 credential chain → nothing, unchanged httpfs error). No new dependency. New tests in src/s3/cli-query.test.ts: direct-keys precedence, profile credential injection asserted on the SQL issued to DuckDB (hermetic), cfg.profile fallback, no-credentials unchanged failure, loud unresolvable-profile failure. Live: pre-fix 403 No credentials with AWS_PROFILE set; post-fix read_json_auto over s3:// returns rows.", "foreman_note": "Wave duckbrain-2026-09-20-01-17-40, base 9fbbd60. Merged no-ff into feat/native-s3 in dispatch order. Merged-tree gate independently re-run by the foreman: unit 155 files / 1226 tests exit 0, tsc exit 0, prettier src/ clean, integration 44/44 exit 0. AGENTS.md counts synced 1212 -> 1226 in the same push."}
